           and focusing the spin button used to scroll it ~8px (layout jitter). */
        overflow: clip;
        /* Establish containing block so the absolutely-positioned .detail-view
           (when inactive) is clipped by overflow:hidden.  Without this, the
           detail-view's populated content extends into the keen-slider slide's
           overflow area, making scrollHeight > clientHeight, which causes
           keen-slider to yield touch events to native scroll instead of
           triggering a slide transition. */
        position: relative;
    }

    .roller-view,
